# Rendered walkthroughs are large binaries. They are git-ignored by default (see
# .gitignore: examples/*/out/). If you ever DO choose to commit one, route it through
# Git LFS rather than the pack — run `git lfs install` once, then add normally.
**/out/*.mp4 filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
examples/**/*.mp4 filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
